  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "22864664-715d-4cf7-a9ed-9d8bfea938eb",
    "name": "mtpx minimal app",
    "description": "Collection para testar o exemplo minimal-app do Multpex Framework.\n\n## Autentica\u00e7\u00e3o\n\nUse o grupo **Auth (Keycloak)** para obter token e preencher `accessToken` automaticamente.\n\nEndpoints protegidos (DELETE, Admin) exigem Bearer token.\nDefina o valor da vari\u00e1vel `accessToken` no environment.\n\n## Endpoints\n\n- **GET /minimal-app/items** - Listar items\n- **GET /minimal-app/items/:id** - Buscar item por ID\n- **POST /minimal-app/items** - Criar item (com valida\u00e7\u00e3o Zod)\n- **DELETE /minimal-app/items/:id** - Deletar item (requer auth + role admin)\n\n## Admin\n\n- **GET /minimal-app/admin/stats** - Estat\u00edsticas (requer role admin)\n\n## Health\n\n- **GET /minimal-app/health** - Health check\n- **GET /minimal-app/ready** - Readiness check\n- **GET /minimal-app/live** - Liveness check",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "20667599",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/20667599-22864664-715d-4cf7-a9ed-9d8bfea938eb?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Refresh Token (Keycloak) \u2014 manual",
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            {
              "key": "grant_type",
              "value": "refresh_token",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "key": "client_id",
              "value": "{{keycloakClientId}}",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "key": "refresh_token",
              "value": "{{refreshToken}}",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{keycloakUrl}}/realms/{{keycloakRealm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token",
          "host": [
            "{{keycloakUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "realms",
            "{{keycloakRealm}}",
            "protocol",
            "openid-connect",
            "token"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Manual refresh \u2014 normally the collection pre-request script handles this automatically."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const data = pm.response.json();",
              "if (data.access_token) {",
              "  pm.environment.set('accessToken', data.access_token);",
              "  pm.environment.set('accessTokenExpiresAt', String(Math.floor(Date.now()/1000) + (data.expires_in || 300)));",
              "  if (data.refresh_token) pm.environment.set('refreshToken', data.refresh_token);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
